WEBVTT

00:06.110 --> 00:07.560
Whatcha doing?

00:08.190 --> 00:10.280
Oh, hey, Ishikura.

00:10.280 --> 00:11.650
You're not heading home?

00:12.070 --> 00:14.740
My parents are actually at home today.

00:14.740 --> 00:15.990
So?

00:17.370 --> 00:20.160
It's best if I'm not around.

00:22.710 --> 00:24.710
We're the same, then.

00:28.630 --> 00:31.010
How 'bout I stay with you?

00:32.760 --> 00:34.680
So you won't be lonely!

00:40.390 --> 00:41.770
<b>I'm Getting Married</b>

00:41.770 --> 00:43.350
<b>to a Girl I Hate in My Class</b>

00:43.640 --> 00:46.350
<b>I'm Getting Married to a Girl I Hate in My Class</b>

01:49.380 --> 01:50.040
<b>I'm Getting Married to a Girl I Hate in My Class</b>

02:01.260 --> 02:05.980
<b>I'm Getting Married
to a Girl I Hate
in My Class</b>

02:06.100 --> 02:10.020
<b>#10      Girlfriend (Tentative)</b>

02:06.350 --> 02:08.390
That's true.

02:08.390 --> 02:10.520
I'll head home, then.

02:10.520 --> 02:11.400
Good.

02:12.690 --> 02:13.980
I knew it...

02:14.270 --> 02:18.600
Akane really does live with Saito-kun.

02:19.410 --> 02:20.280
They live together?

02:20.280 --> 02:22.030
Who? Saito-kun and Akane-chan?

02:22.030 --> 02:22.950
No way!

02:23.780 --> 02:26.410
A-Are you kidding? I'd never live with him!

02:26.410 --> 02:29.790
Living with scum like this 
would turn me <i>into</i> scum!

02:29.790 --> 02:31.250
That reminds me, I saw them!

02:31.250 --> 02:32.170
In the shopping district?

02:32.170 --> 02:32.790
So it was a date?

02:32.790 --> 02:34.500
Hang on! Calm down, guys.

02:34.500 --> 02:36.670
I'd never fall for a nutcase like her.

02:36.670 --> 02:38.300
Who are you calling a nutcase?!

02:38.300 --> 02:40.470
You're the one always trashing our hou—

02:42.760 --> 02:46.180
<i>Great</i>. Because of you, there's 
a rumor going around about us!

02:46.180 --> 02:48.560
<i>You're</i> the one who let it slip!

02:48.560 --> 02:51.400
Talking about me coming 
home in front of everyone.

02:51.400 --> 02:53.560
So you're saying it's <i>my</i> fault?

02:53.560 --> 02:55.570
Fine, then, don't even bother coming home!

02:55.570 --> 02:56.770
That makes no sense!

02:59.860 --> 03:01.910
You look rough, Brother-kun.

03:03.450 --> 03:06.410
Can you blame me with all these paparazzi?

03:06.410 --> 03:10.330
Don't worry. A wonder lasts but 90,000 days.

03:10.330 --> 03:11.870
That's like over 200 years.

03:11.870 --> 03:14.420
It's veering into legendary status.

03:14.420 --> 03:17.170
You'll transcend time and 
become a legend in the sky.

03:17.170 --> 03:18.550
Screw that.

03:19.300 --> 03:20.970
We're being followed.

03:20.970 --> 03:22.680
Mm-hmm. There's three of them.

03:22.680 --> 03:24.430
You can tell without looking?

03:24.430 --> 03:26.930
Shise's a pro at being followed.

03:27.140 --> 03:29.600
What now? Should I call a sniper?

03:29.600 --> 03:32.190
We're not casually sniping our classmates.

03:32.520 --> 03:36.440
Dammit, they're planning to follow 
me home to get proof of the house.

03:36.440 --> 03:38.570
Wanna come to Shise's place?

03:38.570 --> 03:41.650
You'll be set with three 
meals and a nap with me.

03:41.650 --> 03:44.570
No, I should really get back home.

03:44.910 --> 03:48.580
Gramps is catching on about 
us not living together lately.

03:48.580 --> 03:51.210
Then we have to find a way to lose them.

03:51.210 --> 03:53.000
Got any good ideas?

03:53.000 --> 03:56.500
Carry Shise and run for your life.

03:56.500 --> 03:58.210
I wouldn't call that a plan.

03:58.210 --> 04:00.590
Simple is best.

04:00.590 --> 04:02.050
Let's gooooo.

04:08.310 --> 04:12.020
I stayed on until the last stop 
like you suggested, but...

04:12.690 --> 04:14.730
Where the hell are we?

04:14.940 --> 04:17.480
Oh, man. The next bus isn't until tomorrow.

04:17.480 --> 04:19.110
Can you call your ride?

04:19.110 --> 04:20.980
No service.

04:20.980 --> 04:23.990
So we can only get home on foot?

04:23.990 --> 04:25.500
Let's gooooo.

04:25.500 --> 04:27.370
You're walking, too!

04:28.110 --> 04:30.290
Shise can't walk. The reason being...

04:30.290 --> 04:35.920
I took a bullet for you and 
it hit me in the chest.

04:35.920 --> 04:37.920
Great, I'll just leave you here, then.

04:39.130 --> 04:40.250
Huh?

04:40.800 --> 04:42.380
We're here to take you home.

04:42.380 --> 04:43.510
You <i>again</i>!

04:43.800 --> 04:45.760
How did you find us?

04:45.760 --> 04:48.390
There's a tracking device on Miss Shisei.

04:48.680 --> 04:50.010
Of course.

04:50.200 --> 04:51.720
<i>Meh.</i>

04:50.470 --> 04:51.720
Well, this is a relief.

04:51.970 --> 04:53.980
Glad to be of help.

04:53.980 --> 04:55.850
We'll be off then.

04:55.850 --> 04:58.360
Hey! What about me?!

04:59.360 --> 05:02.110
We're almost all out of rice.

05:02.570 --> 05:06.950
Yeah, but we might run into classmates.

05:06.950 --> 05:09.200
We can't even make a grocery run.

05:09.200 --> 05:12.870
We're doomed to starve to death!

05:12.870 --> 05:14.620
No one's gonna starve.

05:14.620 --> 05:18.290
We can eat cake if there's no rice.

05:19.130 --> 05:22.420
You're the reason we're running 
out of rice so fast!

05:24.920 --> 05:28.390
D-Did you hear that sound?

05:31.810 --> 05:34.140
Someone's under the covers.

05:34.140 --> 05:35.560
Wh-What are you doing?

05:35.560 --> 05:37.810
Getting them before they get us!
 Sengoku era style!

05:37.810 --> 05:39.900
The Warring States period ended 400 years ago!

05:39.900 --> 05:41.980
Not for me, it didn't!

05:41.980 --> 05:43.270
That's enough!

05:43.530 --> 05:44.780
Don't touch me, you pervert!

05:44.780 --> 05:46.650
Not before you let go of that weapon!

05:46.650 --> 05:48.030
<i>You</i> let go!

05:51.410 --> 05:53.790
Hey... Get off...

05:53.790 --> 05:57.960
Look! Onee-chan and Onii-chan are having 
sexy time in the middle of the day!

05:57.960 --> 05:59.530
Better upload some pics!

06:00.220 --> 06:03.750
N-No! This is a misunderstanding! Saito just...

06:03.750 --> 06:06.090
Maho, when did you get here?

06:06.090 --> 06:08.220
I didn't hear the doorbell ring.

06:08.220 --> 06:10.590
Why would I ring the doorbell?

06:10.590 --> 06:11.970
This is my house.

06:11.970 --> 06:13.720
It most certainly is not.

06:13.720 --> 06:15.720
Himarin's here, too.

06:15.720 --> 06:17.980
Hope you don't mind.

06:18.560 --> 06:19.980
Himari?

06:20.600 --> 06:22.230
I'm sorry, Akane.

06:22.230 --> 06:23.100
Huh?

06:23.400 --> 06:26.110
This is all my fault.

06:26.110 --> 06:31.370
None of this would have happened 
if I'd just kept my mouth shut.

06:31.370 --> 06:33.110
It's not your fault.

06:33.110 --> 06:36.750
We were wrong to keep it from 
you in the first place.

06:37.330 --> 06:38.660
"We"?

06:38.660 --> 06:41.130
Did I say something weird?

06:41.130 --> 06:44.210
Nope! Anyway, this is on me.

06:44.210 --> 06:48.770
I'll do everything I can so things die down!

06:48.980 --> 06:51.300
Hey, I'm real sorry.

06:51.300 --> 06:53.720
Huh? What are you apologizing for?

06:53.720 --> 06:57.770
For keeping it a secret that 
Akane and I live together.

06:57.770 --> 07:01.900
Oh, that. Don't worry about it!

07:01.900 --> 07:03.270
You're not mad?

07:03.270 --> 07:05.190
Should I be?

07:05.190 --> 07:08.400
I mean, I was lying to you this entire time.

07:08.400 --> 07:12.030
We basically ended up tricking you.

07:12.530 --> 07:13.530
I'm sorry.

07:13.530 --> 07:15.990
You didn't do anything wrong, Saito-kun!

07:15.990 --> 07:20.160
Besides, I kinda had a feeling that 
you were living togetherfor a while.

07:20.160 --> 07:21.300
You did?

07:21.300 --> 07:24.500
You had the same lunch, 
the same shampoo scent, and

07:24.500 --> 07:26.920
Saito-kun knew his way around 
the house way too well.

07:26.920 --> 07:28.460
It wasn't hard to figure out, you know!

07:28.460 --> 07:31.300
With your family being 
the Hojo Group and all,

07:31.300 --> 07:33.300
I figured you married for the business!

07:33.300 --> 07:36.100
I get why you couldn't tell me.
 It's a family matter!

07:36.720 --> 07:40.180
<i>With her good instincts, it's no 
wonder Himari figured it out.</i>

07:40.680 --> 07:43.440
It's actually not about the business.

07:43.440 --> 07:47.230
My grandpa and Akane's grandma fell 
in love when they were younger.

07:47.230 --> 07:52.700
And now they're using their grandkids 
to relive their unfulfilled love.

07:52.700 --> 07:54.410
So that's what it was.

07:54.410 --> 07:58.330
So basically, it's a marriage 
with zero romantic feelings?

07:58.330 --> 07:59.290
Yeah.

08:00.120 --> 08:03.710
That means I still have a chance then!

08:04.000 --> 08:05.250
That's, uhh...

08:05.710 --> 08:07.880
Let's get started!

08:07.880 --> 08:11.930
The "how to end the rumors of Onee-chan 
and Onii-chan" strategy conference!

08:12.590 --> 08:13.970
Yes, Shii-chan?

08:13.970 --> 08:17.760
We catch every student spreading 
rumors and zap their brains.

08:17.760 --> 08:19.350
Their brains? Not just their memories?

08:19.350 --> 08:20.220
They'd all die!

08:20.220 --> 08:22.850
I think you're on the right track!

08:22.850 --> 08:25.020
Not really, like, at all.

08:25.020 --> 08:27.610
Hey! How about something like this?

08:27.610 --> 08:28.860
Like what?

08:28.860 --> 08:32.490
The rumor's that Akane and Saito-kun 
are dating and living together, right?

08:32.490 --> 08:35.730
So we just need to show 
them the opposite of that!

08:41.160 --> 08:43.250
Morning, Shisei-chan!

08:43.250 --> 08:45.170
You look cute today!

08:45.170 --> 08:46.130
Want some sardines?

08:46.130 --> 08:47.750
Here's some sweets, too!

08:48.710 --> 08:51.010
Come by again!

08:51.260 --> 08:55.090
So much for Himari's idea to 
play girlfriend and boyfriend.

08:55.470 --> 08:57.220
This isn't working at all.

08:57.220 --> 09:00.350
We've always been too close to each other.

09:00.350 --> 09:02.890
Shise knew it wouldn't work.

09:02.890 --> 09:04.180
Then <i>say</i> that!

09:04.180 --> 09:07.860
We need to be more aggressive 
for people to notice.

09:07.860 --> 09:10.610
Brother-kun should kiss Shise.

09:10.860 --> 09:12.600
On the lips.

09:12.600 --> 09:15.110
No way. That's taking it too far.

09:15.110 --> 09:17.570
I promise they taste good.

09:17.570 --> 09:18.740
I'm not worried about that.

09:18.740 --> 09:20.410
No kissing, okay?

09:20.410 --> 09:21.870
You save that for someone else.

09:23.870 --> 09:26.040
It's too late for that.

09:26.620 --> 09:29.120
Fine, I'll go next!

09:29.120 --> 09:30.210
I think I'll pass.

09:30.210 --> 09:31.300
Why?!

09:31.300 --> 09:33.760
'Cause I dunno what you might pull on me.

09:33.760 --> 09:34.630
Poke.

09:34.630 --> 09:36.760
What's that, Onii-chan?

09:36.760 --> 09:39.300
That sounds like you <i>want </i>
me to pull something.

09:39.300 --> 09:41.220
Definitely not.

09:41.220 --> 09:42.770
Either way, you're out of the question.

09:43.850 --> 09:45.770
Why, though?!

09:45.760 --> 09:48.690
If it's not Shisei-san or 
Maho, it's gotta be...

09:46.730 --> 09:50.310
Onii-chan, you dummy! You suck!

09:48.690 --> 09:52.320
Oh, boy. Am I the only other option?

09:52.320 --> 09:54.440
We can think of another 
plan if you'd rather not.

09:54.440 --> 09:55.610
No! That's okay!

09:55.610 --> 09:58.280
It makes me happy to be able to help you!

09:58.280 --> 09:59.990
I'm totally up for it!

09:59.990 --> 10:00.990
You sure?

10:00.990 --> 10:01.780
Yeah!

10:02.240 --> 10:05.250
Starting tomorrow, we'll be 
boyfriend and girlfriend!

10:05.250 --> 10:07.580
I'll put on an award-winning performance!

10:07.580 --> 10:10.540
I hope you can keep up, Saito-kun!

10:11.290 --> 10:12.670
Wh-What?

10:12.670 --> 10:15.630
The dishes are done and 
I've separated the trash—

10:15.630 --> 10:18.090
I just thought I should 
warn you ahead of time.

10:18.090 --> 10:19.930
You mean like avoid dark alleys at night?

10:19.930 --> 10:21.050
That's not it!

10:21.050 --> 10:22.720
Listen...

10:22.720 --> 10:26.100
It can't be helped that you have 
to play pretend with Himari.

10:26.100 --> 10:29.810
But don't forget it's only acting, okay?

10:30.060 --> 10:32.060
Why would you need to remind me that?

10:32.060 --> 10:34.430
Because you're an idiot, that's why!

10:34.430 --> 10:38.490
God forbid you get caught up in 
the moment and things happen.

10:38.490 --> 10:40.320
That would put us in a whole other mess!

10:40.320 --> 10:41.570
Things like what?

10:41.570 --> 10:44.200
D-Don't make me say it! 
Are you <i>trying</i> to upset me?

10:44.200 --> 10:47.660
I just need to be clear of the 
boundaries going into this.

10:47.660 --> 10:49.830
What exactly can I do as part of the act?

10:49.830 --> 10:52.710
Hugging? Kissing? Or...

10:52.710 --> 10:54.340
A-All of it.

10:54.340 --> 10:55.210
Huh?

10:55.210 --> 10:57.760
I'm fine with all of it.

10:57.760 --> 11:03.350
But in return, you'll have to 
make up for it with <i>everything</i>.

11:05.810 --> 11:07.860
Morning, Saito-kun!

11:09.020 --> 11:11.600
We're already acting, okay?

11:11.600 --> 11:15.230
Himari! What are you whispering 
about with Hojo-kun?

11:15.230 --> 11:17.610
It's nothing!

11:17.610 --> 11:19.740
You two look suspicious!

11:19.740 --> 11:22.110
I swear, it's nothing!

11:22.570 --> 11:24.780
Saito-kun! Let's go eat lunch!

11:24.780 --> 11:26.830
Don't you usually eat with Akane?

11:26.830 --> 11:29.750
Umm, usually, yeah.

11:30.460 --> 11:33.750
But I thought we should 
just eat together today.

11:34.170 --> 11:35.920
Or would you rather not?

11:35.920 --> 11:37.460
It's not like that, but...

11:38.010 --> 11:40.510
Great! Then let's go!

11:42.010 --> 11:44.260
Return here

11:48.560 --> 11:50.060
So what next?

11:50.060 --> 11:52.770
Let's see. How about...

11:53.270 --> 11:54.810
In here?

11:54.810 --> 11:55.520
Yup.

11:55.520 --> 11:57.400
First, we eat lunch at the cafeteria.

11:57.400 --> 12:01.650
Then we spend time alone somewhere 
quiet before class starts.

12:02.450 --> 12:04.820
That's what I wanted to do with you.

12:04.820 --> 12:05.570
Huh?

12:05.570 --> 12:07.660
Oh, it's nothing!

12:09.830 --> 12:12.410
This kinda feels like we're being sneaky.

12:12.960 --> 12:16.290
What exactly do we do to act 
like boyfriend and girlfriend?

12:16.290 --> 12:18.670
I'm not sure, actually.

12:18.670 --> 12:21.220
You don't know? It was your idea.

12:21.220 --> 12:23.680
I mean, I <i>know</i>.

12:23.680 --> 12:26.350
But there's just too 
many things that come to mind.

12:26.350 --> 12:28.390
I'm having a hard time picking.

12:28.970 --> 12:31.020
Wh-Why are you laughing?

12:31.020 --> 12:33.730
You're usually comfortable in any situation.

12:33.730 --> 12:35.400
So this is a side I've never seen.

12:36.900 --> 12:39.940
How could I be comfortable?

12:39.940 --> 12:41.990
I actually like you.

12:41.990 --> 12:43.860
Anything you wanna do, go for it.

12:43.860 --> 12:45.030
I'm down for whatever.

12:45.030 --> 12:46.280
Anything?

12:46.280 --> 12:47.280
Yeah.

12:47.530 --> 12:50.200
As long as we're acting.

12:50.200 --> 12:51.040
Then...

12:51.620 --> 12:54.250
Will you cuddle with me?

12:54.250 --> 12:55.290
Cuddle?

12:55.290 --> 13:02.510
U-Um, well, see, I've actually always been 
jealous of how you cuddle Shisei-chan.

13:02.510 --> 13:04.170
I wanted you to do that to me.

13:04.170 --> 13:05.930
O-Okay.

13:05.930 --> 13:09.640
I-It's weird coming from 
a giant like me, I know!

13:09.640 --> 13:11.930
I might end up crushing you.

13:11.930 --> 13:13.930
Sorry, never mind! Forget I said that!

13:14.560 --> 13:17.060
Nah, you won't crush me.

13:17.520 --> 13:19.860
Promise you won't break?

13:19.860 --> 13:22.400
Don't underestimate a man's muscles.

13:23.240 --> 13:24.820
If you say so.

13:25.570 --> 13:27.820
Am I too heavy?

13:27.820 --> 13:29.070
You're not heavy.

13:30.280 --> 13:32.950
But maybe this is a bit much.

13:33.290 --> 13:34.830
Everyone's watching.

13:34.830 --> 13:36.370
You gotta try harder.

13:36.370 --> 13:37.580
Try harder?

13:37.580 --> 13:39.380
How though?

13:39.380 --> 13:41.840
Play it off like we're actually close.

13:42.420 --> 13:44.600
Can you hug me tighter?

13:46.590 --> 13:48.140
See? They're hugging!

13:48.140 --> 13:49.600
Oh my god!

13:51.060 --> 13:52.810
Is that enough?

13:52.810 --> 13:56.350
Don't stop yet. People are still watching.

13:57.650 --> 13:59.900
How much longer do we need to do this for?

13:59.900 --> 14:04.650
I dunno. Just a bit longer. Just a bit.

14:05.650 --> 14:07.610
Himari! What's going on?

14:07.610 --> 14:09.870
What do you mean?

14:09.870 --> 14:11.870
I mean you and Hojo-kun!

14:11.870 --> 14:15.370
People are saying they saw you 
two in an empty classroom!

14:15.370 --> 14:17.040
That you two were, umm...

14:17.040 --> 14:21.250
Oops, someone saw that? Oh boy!

14:21.750 --> 14:23.710
You better fill us in!

14:23.710 --> 14:26.050
Saito-kun, what do you think?

14:26.050 --> 14:28.630
Should we tell them about us?

14:28.880 --> 14:31.050
Well, sure, why not?

14:31.390 --> 14:35.880
The truth is that Saito-kun and I are dating.

14:37.640 --> 14:38.480
Why?!

14:38.480 --> 14:39.480
What about Akane-chan?

14:39.480 --> 14:40.190
Did they break up?

14:40.190 --> 14:41.810
Was he cheating?

14:41.810 --> 14:43.770
Sorry, I didn't mean to confuse you guys.

14:43.770 --> 14:48.360
I was just joking when I said Saito-kun 
and Akane were living together.

14:48.360 --> 14:49.490
Joking?

14:49.490 --> 14:52.120
Saito-kun and I were already 
going out, but when I saw

14:52.120 --> 14:55.870
him being friendly with 
Akane, I got a bit jealous.

14:55.870 --> 14:58.330
I should have told you sooner.

14:58.330 --> 15:01.500
I'm sorry I caused such 
a huge misunderstanding!

15:01.500 --> 15:04.040
You don't need to apologize.

15:04.040 --> 15:06.510
We're sorry, too.

15:08.920 --> 15:13.050
Phew, good thing we don't 
need to lie anymore.

15:13.050 --> 15:17.270
But now we're officially recognized as 
boyfriend and girlfriend.

15:17.270 --> 15:18.270
Y-Yeah.

15:20.810 --> 15:22.230
I can barely walk.

15:22.230 --> 15:23.690
That's okay!

15:23.690 --> 15:25.070
I'm not okay.

15:25.070 --> 15:26.820
But I'm your girlfriend!

15:27.900 --> 15:30.650
Don't you think it's a bit too much?

15:30.650 --> 15:31.660
What is?

15:31.660 --> 15:33.620
I-I mean about Saito.

15:33.620 --> 15:35.990
Do you really need to take it that far?

15:35.990 --> 15:37.040
You're kind of like...

15:37.040 --> 15:38.080
Like?

15:38.080 --> 15:39.780
Like the PDA couple.

15:39.780 --> 15:41.790
Is that what we look like?!

15:41.790 --> 15:43.380
Why does that make you happy?

15:43.380 --> 15:47.550
If it seems that way to you, that 
means the plan was a success!

15:47.550 --> 15:50.760
Wow. PDA with Saito-kun. Cool.

15:51.180 --> 15:54.920
Either way, I don't know about you 
being all over him like that.

15:54.920 --> 15:57.180
It's better to go a little overboard.

15:57.180 --> 16:01.230
Or else we won't be able to 
fully wipe out that rumor.

16:01.230 --> 16:03.770
But... But...

16:04.860 --> 16:09.030
Sorry your first date had to be 
this weird pretend scenario.

16:09.030 --> 16:11.320
No, that's okay.

16:11.320 --> 16:15.440
I'm just happy to be able 
to go home with you!

16:15.870 --> 16:17.830
I promise to return the favor one day.

16:17.830 --> 16:21.210
Really? I'll have to think of a good one!

16:21.210 --> 16:22.960
<b>Nekooka Bookstore</b>

16:29.120 --> 16:29.880
I did it!

16:29.130 --> 16:32.630
Game Center Heiandai

16:29.880 --> 16:32.630
Good job, Onee-chan! Me next!

