16:35.510 --> 16:38.010
Crêpes

16:38.430 --> 16:40.100
Today was fun.

16:40.100 --> 16:41.020
Really?

16:41.350 --> 16:45.270
Look, I'm sorry I got you mixed up in this.

16:46.230 --> 16:48.070
I'm off, then.

16:49.780 --> 16:50.900
Saito-kun!

16:52.610 --> 16:55.030
Would you wanna stop by for a bit?

16:55.030 --> 17:00.040
I got this Darjeeling tea 
at the café I work at!

17:00.040 --> 17:02.160
Uhh, I don't know.

17:02.160 --> 17:03.790
You're right.

17:05.460 --> 17:06.580
See ya.

17:06.580 --> 17:08.380
Yup! Bye!

17:24.230 --> 17:25.440
Saito-kun.

17:25.730 --> 17:29.940
I'll stop by for a bit. I 
can't stay long, though.

17:30.900 --> 17:31.940
Come on in.

17:36.460 --> 17:37.570
Something wrong?

17:37.570 --> 17:39.990
No, it's a quiet place.

17:39.990 --> 17:42.200
Yeah, I guess.

17:42.580 --> 17:43.950
Wait, is that...

17:43.950 --> 17:45.410
Oh! Sorry!

17:45.410 --> 17:46.710
This isn't me stalking or anything!

17:46.710 --> 17:49.920
I ended up buying a copy 
during our school trip!

17:49.920 --> 17:52.630
It's creepy having this, I know!

17:52.630 --> 17:54.590
That's fine, do whatever you want.

17:55.720 --> 17:59.100
Then can I take more pictures 
and put them up everywhere?

17:59.100 --> 18:01.350
That sounds terrifying, so no.

18:05.100 --> 18:07.620
How to Solve Interpersonal Relationships
Manga that Explains...
What to Know About Mob Mentality
How to Effectively Win People Over
Super Simple! Psychology...
What Cats Teach Us About the Mind
Simple for Even Cats!
Intro to Psychology
Mechanism of Desire and Yearning
Introduction to Group Philosophy
How Emotions Influence Us

18:07.190 --> 18:10.480
<b>Introduction to Group Psychology</b>

18:08.850 --> 18:13.400
<i>Is Himari actually a lot 
smarter than she lets on?</i>

18:16.780 --> 18:18.160
The tea's ready.

18:20.370 --> 18:21.490
This is good.

18:21.490 --> 18:25.750
Right? These tea leaves aren't 
usually sold in stores.

18:25.750 --> 18:26.870
Cool.

18:26.870 --> 18:29.460
Look, it's our class group chat.

18:29.460 --> 18:31.880
Everyone's talking about us.

18:29.460 --> 18:33.030
Ishikura-san and Hojo-kun 
looked real cute together!

18:29.460 --> 18:33.460
I saw them at the
shopping district together

18:31.270 --> 18:33.460
For real? On a date?

18:31.880 --> 18:33.460
Wow.

18:33.460 --> 18:36.470
Your plan actually worked like a charm.

18:37.260 --> 18:39.180
That was just luck.

18:39.180 --> 18:40.890
No, it wasn't.

18:40.890 --> 18:42.470
I saw your bookshelf.

18:43.010 --> 18:44.390
You studied that?

18:45.140 --> 18:46.480
Oh, yeah.

18:46.890 --> 18:49.230
You're interested in psychology?

18:51.270 --> 18:55.820
Remember how I told you that I 
was bullied in grade school?

18:55.820 --> 18:56.660
Yeah.

18:56.990 --> 19:00.820
The bullying stopped thanks to Akane's help.

19:00.820 --> 19:04.540
But I figured I shouldn't 
rely on Akane forever.

19:04.540 --> 19:06.790
So I studied.

19:07.500 --> 19:10.830
How I could keep people 
from attacking me and Akane.

19:10.830 --> 19:14.500
How I could get people to like us.

19:14.500 --> 19:17.130
How I could control the room.

19:18.090 --> 19:19.220
Wow.

19:19.970 --> 19:22.890
It's pretty lame, I know.

19:23.510 --> 19:24.430
No.

19:24.650 --> 19:27.600
I respect you for doing all 
that for your best friend.

19:27.600 --> 19:28.810
Really?

19:28.810 --> 19:29.520
Yeah.

19:30.480 --> 19:34.190
Saito-kun, do you have any 
romantic feelings for Akane?

19:35.320 --> 19:37.530
I don't like her like that.

19:37.530 --> 19:38.440
Then...

19:38.940 --> 19:42.030
That means that I have a chance, right?

19:42.030 --> 19:44.330
I don't mind being the other girl.

19:44.330 --> 19:46.240
You're worth more than that.

19:46.240 --> 19:47.490
I'm not saying I'm cheap!

19:47.490 --> 19:50.820
It's just that as long as I 
have you, I don't care how!

19:53.420 --> 19:54.830
You know...

19:55.290 --> 20:00.220
My parents won't come home 
as long as I'm here.

20:00.220 --> 20:02.470
Really? Same here.

20:02.470 --> 20:03.430
Huh?

20:03.720 --> 20:06.390
My parents don't like me either.

20:06.390 --> 20:08.810
Neither of them were home very much.

20:08.810 --> 20:12.230
I don't remember them ever being 
there for field day or parents' day.

20:12.560 --> 20:13.900
Hilarious, isn't it?

20:15.150 --> 20:17.360
No, it's not.

20:17.360 --> 20:20.440
But it makes me kinda 
happy that we're alike.

20:20.440 --> 20:21.950
I better get going.

20:21.950 --> 20:22.950
No!

20:24.030 --> 20:25.570
It's too lonely.

20:25.570 --> 20:28.450
Just a bit longer. Please?

20:32.670 --> 20:34.250
I'm home.

20:34.250 --> 20:37.130
Were you with Himari this entire time?

20:37.130 --> 20:38.590
Y-Yeah.

20:38.960 --> 20:43.010
We strolled around town before 
I stopped by her place.

20:43.010 --> 20:46.260
Her place? What about her parents?

20:46.260 --> 20:47.840
They weren't there today.

20:50.310 --> 20:51.520
Hey!

20:55.440 --> 20:56.690
Hello?

20:56.690 --> 21:00.360
<i>Hey, Akane! Did Saito-kun get home okay?</i>

21:00.360 --> 21:01.360
Yeah.

21:01.360 --> 21:04.820
<i>Good! He already ate at my place.</i>

21:04.820 --> 21:07.660
Oh. I wasn't making him anything anyway.

21:07.660 --> 21:09.950
<i>So it worked out then!</i>

21:09.950 --> 21:15.210
<i>You know what? I told Saito-kun 
he could wash up here, but—</i>

21:15.210 --> 21:16.420
Hey, Himari.

21:16.420 --> 21:18.460
Pretending to be a couple has gotta be hard.

21:18.460 --> 21:19.550
You can quit if you want.

21:19.550 --> 21:21.260
<i>I don't mind at all!</i>

21:21.260 --> 21:24.630
<i>I don't care as long as I can be 
his girlfriend, even if it's fake!</i>

21:24.630 --> 21:27.090
But I think the rumor's 
quieted down already—

21:27.090 --> 21:29.800
<i>It's not enough. We gotta do more!</i>

21:30.310 --> 21:31.670
For how long?

21:31.670 --> 21:34.410
<i>Hmm... forever, I guess!</i>

21:36.230 --> 21:37.890
<i>Does it bother you?</i>

21:37.890 --> 21:40.940
<i>That Saito-kun and I are together like this.</i>

21:40.940 --> 21:43.440
<i>I can stop if you're jealous.</i>

21:43.440 --> 21:44.990
O-Of course I'm not jealous!

21:44.990 --> 21:47.320
It's not like I have any feelings for him!

21:47.630 --> 21:49.500
<i>Great! Then it's no problem!</i>

21:49.500 --> 21:55.190
<i>You two can live peacefully, and I 
can be lovey-dovey with Saito-kun!</i>

21:55.190 --> 21:56.910
<i>It's a win-win, right?</i>

21:57.250 --> 22:02.260
You're right. It shouldn't be a problem.

23:34.930 --> 23:39.930
<b>#11         Voice</b>
